## Onboarding & Setup

- Typical launch timeline: 4–6 weeks
- Technical setup: approximately 1–2 weeks
- Dedicated Customer Success Manager (CSM) guides onboarding
- 30-day free trial available (hands-on workspace)
- Professional services available for complex implementations
- Technical Success team handles data imports, integrations, and training

## Key Differentiators

- **Depth of customer context**: Revenue, account, and user data is automatically attached to every piece of feedback — not just vote counts
- **AI intelligence layer**: Goes beyond raw collection to detect themes, sentiment, and urgency at scale
- **Closed-loop engagement**: Built-in tools to communicate back to customers, not just collect from them
- **20+ years of experience**: Long track record helping B2B software companies run structured feedback programs
- **De-duplication**: Automatically merges similar ideas so the signal isn't fragmented across hundreds of near-identical requests

## Common Use Cases

- Building a data-driven product roadmap grounded in customer demand
- Identifying and preventing churn by detecting urgency and dissatisfaction signals early
- Validating new feature ideas before investing in development
- Aligning product, CS, and sales teams around a shared view of customer needs
- Communicating product decisions back to customers to improve NPS and retention
- Replacing ad hoc feedback processes (spreadsheets, emails, Slack threads) with a structured system

## Glossary

- **SmartVote**: Uservoice's comparison-based voting system that presents users with paired choices to elicit more reliable prioritization signals without vote exhaustion
- **Idea**: A piece of feedback or feature request submitted by a customer or internal team member
- **Theme**: A cluster of related ideas or feedback items grouped by AI-detected topic similarity
- **Urgency Alert**: A signal triggered when sentiment analysis detects high-intensity or emotionally charged feedback that may indicate churn risk
- **Feedback Intelligence Suite**: Uservoice's AI analytics layer comprising Topic Detection, Theme Tracking, Sentiment Analysis, and Trend Analysis

